// Rift Shard currency - PER-PLAYER wallet (CharacterStats.RiftShards, see CharacterStats.qtn),
// not a shared Frame.Global total. A pickup credits every connected player the same base amount,
// each scaled by their own CharacterStats.RiftShardGainMultiplier (see
// RiftShardUtility.Grant/GrantAll, CurrencyOrbSystem) - each player then spends their own balance
// independently (see docs/breathing-poi.md). EnemyHealthBonusMultiplier below stays a genuinely
// shared/run-wide global - it's Greed's own difficulty-scaling side effect (a flat authored
// constant added once per pick, see GreedMutationData), fully decoupled from the shard total's
// value, so it's untouched by the per-player conversion.
global
{
    // Greed's own difficulty-scaling side effect (enemies gain health), not currency-specific - it
    // just has no better-fitting existing global block to live in. Starts at its natural 0 (no
    // bonus) and is read as 1 + this wherever consumed (EnemySystem.SeedHealth), so an unseeded/
    // never-picked run is a correct no-op rather than needing an explicit 1 seed.
    FP EnemyHealthBonusMultiplier;
}
